<title>INDIA: Torrent Pharmaceuticals 96/97 net up.</title>
<headline>Torrent Pharmaceuticals 96/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Torrent Pharmaceuticals Ltd said on Wednesday that its net profit in 1996/97 (April-March) rose to 332.0 million rupees from 330.1 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company on Tuesday said its gross profit had risen to 494.2 million rupees from 413.7 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
